---
title: About
description: "M'Aiken Magic supports FIRST Robotics Competition Team 1102 at Aiken High School. Meet the people and the mission behind the team."
permalink: /about/
---
<section class="pagehead">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>About the team</h1>
    <p>{{ site.name }} is a robotics team and an education foundation working together to give students in {{ site.region }} hands-on experience in engineering, programming, and business.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<div class="teeth teeth--moss" aria-hidden="true"></div>

<section class="band">
  <div class="wrap split">
    <div class="split__head">
      <h2>Mission</h2>
      <img class="about-logo" src="{{ '/assets/img/brand/logo.png' | url }}" alt="M'Aiken Magic dragon logo with the team number 1102" width="280" height="280" loading="lazy">
    </div>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>The {{ site.longName }} introduces students to engineering and technology through FIRST programs. Students do real work: they design and build a competition robot, write its code, tell its story, and raise the money to run the team.</p>
      <p>The foundation supports {{ site.team }} at {{ site.school }}. The team meets year-round, and adult mentors volunteer their expertise to guide the work.</p>
      <p>Students from any school in {{ site.region }} can join. Our five subteams give every student a place to contribute, whether that is CAD, machining, code, video, or fundraising.</p>
      {% if photos.length %}
      <div class="photos">
        {% for ph in photos %}
        <figure>
          <img src="{{ ('/assets/img/photos/' + ph.file) | url }}" alt="{{ ph.alt }}" loading="lazy" width="{{ ph.width }}" height="{{ ph.height }}">
          {% if ph.caption %}<figcaption>{{ ph.caption }}</figcaption>{% endif %}
        </figure>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band band--fog2">
  <div class="wrap split">
    <div class="split__head">
      <h2>Leadership</h2>
      <p>The adults who guide the team and the foundation.</p>
    </div>
    <ul class="people">
      {% for p in leadership %}
      <li>
        <span class="initials" aria-hidden="true">{{ p.name | initials }}</span>
        <div>
          <h3>{{ p.name }}</h3>
          <p class="role">{{ p.role }}</p>
          {% if p.bio %}<p class="soft">{{ p.bio }}</p>{% endif %}
        </div>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band cta">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Want to be part of it?</h2>
    <p>We are always looking for students, mentors, and sponsors.</p>
    <div class="btn-row">
      <a class="btn btn--moss" href="{{ '/join/' | url }}">Join the team</a>
      <a class="btn btn--line" href="{{ '/sponsors/' | url }}">Sponsor the team</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
